  "description": "Local/CI decision-model drill for the Memory OS rate-limit emergency policy. It proves the repository authority chooses only bounded emergency modes, automatically falls to ROUTE_FAIL_CLOSED at expiry, and permits restoration to NORMAL_CONFIGURED only after every required recovery verification passes. It does not change runtime traffic and is not a production control plane drill.",
